    "input_per_mtok": 4,
    "output_per_mtok": 20,
    "currency": "USD",
    "notes": "Batch API requests are 50% off. Cache reads cost 10% of base input, except 2.5% on Fable 5.1 and Mythos 5.1 and 5% on Opus 5.5 — so effective price depends heavily on cache strategy."
